        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>Millions of Americans face air quality alerts from Minnesota to New York as authorities urge people to stay indoors</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US newsletter email</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/16/tell-us-how-have-you-been-affected-by-the-spread-of-wildfire-smoke-in-the-us-and-canada\">Tell us: have you been affected by the spread of wildfire smoke in the US and Canada?</a></p></li></ul><p>Smoke from wildfires burning in south-central <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/wildfires-smoke-canada-minnesota-08d3fb58a434a5d42803ab1c2bbda0b3\">Canada and parts of Minnesota</a> is spreading across the US, prompting air quality alerts in more than 20 states with millions of Americans expected to face unhealthy air conditions this week.</p><p>The smoke from the more than <a href=\"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/ontario-wildfire-smoke-moves-east/\">180</a> active <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/15/wildfires-in-ontario-make-toronto-canada-air-quality-worst-in-world\">wildfires in northern Ontario</a> made Chicago’s air quality the <a href=\"https://www.iqair.com/world-air-quality-ranking\">worst in the world</a> on Thursday evening, followed by Detroit and Minneapolis, according to IQAir’s global rankings.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/16/smoke-canadian-wildfires-air-quality\">Continue reading...</a>"
